","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 温成皇后閤四首 其四","author":"欧阳修","text":"内助从来上所嘉，新春不忍见新花。\n君王念旧怜遗族，常使无权保厥家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 夫人閤五首 其一","author":"欧阳修","text":"太史颁时令，农家候土牛。\n青林自花发，黄屋为民忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 温成皇后閤四首 其三","author":"欧阳修","text":"椒壁轻寒转晓晖，珠帘不动暖风微。\n可怜春色来依旧，惟有馀香散不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇后閤五首 其三","author":"欧阳修","text":"初欣綵胜迎春早，已觉鸡人报漏迟。\n风色结寒犹料峭，天光煦物已融怡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇后閤五首 其二","author":"欧阳修","text":"蔼蔼珠帘日，溶溶碧瓦烟。\n漪涟采荇水，和暖浴蚕天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇后閤五首 其四","author":"欧阳修","text":"莺寒未报宫花发，风暖还催腊雪销。\n欲识春来自何处，先从天上斗回杓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇后閤五首 其一","author":"欧阳修","text":"御水冰销绿，宫梅雪压香。\n新年贺交泰，白日渐舒长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇帝閤六首 其六","author":"欧阳修","text":"熙熙人物乐春台，风送春从天上来。\n玉辇经年不游幸，上林花好莫争开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇帝閤六首 其五","author":"欧阳修","text":"朝云蔼蔼弄春晖，万木欣欣暖尚微。\n造化未尝私一物，各随妍丑自芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇帝閤六首 其四","author":"欧阳修","text":"玉琯气来灰已动，东郊风至晓先迎。\n乾坤有信如符契，草木无知但发生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇帝閤六首 其三","author":"欧阳修","text":"气候三阳始，勾萌万物新。\n雷声初发号，天下已知春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词 皇帝閤六首 其二","author":"欧阳修","text":"阳进升君子，阴消退小人。\n圣君南面治，布政法新春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192