嵩巫亭","author":"欧阳修","text":"平地烟霄向此分，绣楣丹槛照清芬。\n风帘暮捲秋空碧，剩见西山数岭云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望州坡","author":"欧阳修","text":"闻说夷陵人为愁，共言迁客不堪游。\n崎岖几日山行倦，却喜坡头见峡州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"欧阳修","text":"夜凉吹笛千山月，路暗迷人百种花。\n棋罢不知人换世，酒阑无奈客思家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琅琊山六题 其三 石屏路","author":"欧阳修","text":"石屏自倚浮云外，石路久无人迹行。\n我来携酒醉其下，卧看千峰秋月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琅琊山六题 其四 班春亭","author":"欧阳修","text":"信马寻春踏雪泥，醉中山水弄清辉。\n野僧不用相迎送，乘兴闲来兴尽归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琅琊山六题 其五 庶子泉","author":"欧阳修","text":"庶子遗踪留此地，寒岩徙倚弄飞泉。\n古人不见心可见，一片清光长皎然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":29656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琅琊山六题 其六 惠觉方丈","author":"欧阳修","text":"青松行尽到山门，乱峰深处开方丈。\n已能宴